One last improvement

I would add a "Search Intent Gate" before any development.

A tool cannot be built unless all of these are true:

✅ Real search demand in Keyword Planner.
✅ Targeted to one or more GCC countries.
✅ Arabic-first.
✅ Solves a specific user task.
✅ Can be significantly better than the current search results.
✅ Fits into an existing hub/category.
✅ Has at least 5–10 closely related keywords for internal linking.
✅ Can reuse existing UI components.
✅ Evergreen (or has a clear update strategy if not).
✅ Produces a meaningful, interactive result—not just static text.

If any of these fail, the idea goes into a backlog instead of development.




